WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The store rules.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.500
This output has only an iPhone set.
But my app also runs on iPad.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.000
check tells me: the App Store needs
13-inch iPad screenshots.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Now I make a copy and resize
one screenshot to 1000x2000.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
The App Store does not take that
size. check names the file.

6
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.600
It checks sizes, counts, transparency
and device sets for both stores.
